      "id": "outcome.01.victory",
      "category": "outcome",
      "status": "generated",
      "script": "The surviving warriors cross the boundary as the labyrinth shifts behind them.\n\nPassages fold closed. Walls grind together, swallowing the route you used only moments before.\n\nEnough of the team made it through.\n\nThe tomb tried to seal you inside.\n\nIt failed.\n\nMission accomplished.",
