      "id": "outcome.01.defeat",
      "category": "outcome",
      "status": "generated",
      "script": "The last routes begin to close.\n\nOne passage after another vanishes behind walls of living metal until the labyrinth becomes silent once more.\n\nToo few escaped before the tomb completed its transformation.\n\nThe survivors are scattered.\n\nThe mission is lost.",
