      "id": "outcome.02.defeat",
      "category": "outcome",
      "status": "generated",
      "script": "The sealed network holds.\n\nThe openings you forced are not enough. Beyond them, ancient barriers remain intact as the tomb begins securing the damaged passages.\n\nThe route was never fully broken.\n\nThe way forward remains closed.\n\nMission failed.",
