      "id": "outcome.03.defeat",
      "category": "outcome",
      "status": "generated",
      "script": "The signal fades.\n\nWhether buried somewhere within the crypt or lost with those who tried to recover it, the transponder remains beyond reach.\n\nStatic fills the channel.\n\nThen nothing.\n\nWhatever information it carried will remain inside the Tomb World.\n\nMission failed.",
      "scriptHash": "2d7005f6931154f59b4c4862a4cea514e921bd064cc42977909f3d87ad2ba76f",
      "outputFile": "outcomes/03-recover-transponder-defeat.mp3",
