      "voiceId": "keNGlRe631vnQRvGXasN",
      "modelId": "eleven_multilingual_v2"
    },
    {
      "id": "outcome.04.victory",
      "category": "outcome",
      "status": "generated",
      "script": "The final breach tears through the sarcophagus.\n\nLiving metal splits beneath cascading emerald energy as the stasis systems collapse. Across the chamber, ancient mechanisms flicker and die.\n\nWhatever was meant to awaken here will remain entombed.\n\nMission accomplished.",
